WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:01.067 line:0%
G

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:06.106 line:0%
TIRELESSLY, TO BRING FORMER

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:11.077 line:0%
STUDENT, SAFELY, TO ITALY.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:11.578 line:0%
&gt;&gt; TEACHER, AND STUDENT,

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:16.349 line:0%
MEANING AGAIN.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:16.716 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WELCOME, WELCOME, WELCOME TO

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.052 line:0%
ITALY.

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:19.586 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SHE FOUNDED, AND RANA,

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:22.422 line:0%
SCHOOL IN KABUL.

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:22.756 line:0%
WHERE SHE GRADUATED, 5 YEARS

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:25.358 line:0%
AGO.

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:28.395 line:0%
LAST MONTH, AS THE TALIBAN TOOK

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:30.063 line:0%
OVER KABUL, THEY RECEIVED A

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.463 line:0%
DESPERATE MESSAGE FROM A FORMER

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.332 line:0%
STUDENT.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:35.268 line:0%
DON'T ABANDON ME.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:38.038 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THIS IS A UNIQUE SPACE --

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:40.273 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SHE FOUNDED THE STORY

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:42.175 line:0%
ACADEMY OF 2013, WITH FUNDS SHE

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.642 line:0%
WON FROM THE ROLEX AWARD, FOR

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:45.111 line:0%
ENTERPRISE.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:47.047 line:0%
THE ACADEMY, USING

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:49.082 line:0%
AFGHANISTAN'S AGE OLD ORAL

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:50.116 line:0%
TRADITIONS, AS A MEANS OF

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:52.118 line:0%
EDUCATION.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.485 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SHE TOLD ME, SHE WAS VERY

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.354 line:0%
HAPPY.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:56.222 line:0%
&gt;&gt; MORE THAN 5000 KILOMETERS

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:58.258 line:0%
FROM KABUL, PULLING EVERY

00:00:56.389 --> 00:01:00.260 line:0%
STRING SHE COULD, TO WRANGLE

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:03.063 line:0%
PLACES FOR HER FORMER STUDENTS,

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:04.197 line:0%
AND THEIR FAMILIES, ON ITALIAN

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:06.166 line:0%
MILITARY, FLIGHTS OUT OF THE

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:09.069 line:0%
AFGHAN CAPITAL.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:10.270 line:0%
HER, AND HER FAMILY, MADE IT

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.737 line:0%
THROUGH THE PANDEMONIUM, AND ON

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:15.175 line:0%
TO A PLANE.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:17.143 line:0%
THEY, ARE NOW, IN A SMALL TOWN

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:21.047 line:0%
IN SOUTHERN ITALY.

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:23.149 line:0%
ANOTHER FORMER STUDENT, AND HIS

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:26.352 line:0%
FAMILY, WERE ABLE TO GET ON A

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:29.322 line:0%
FLIGHT OUT, BUT BARELY.

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:32.025 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SHE TEXTED ME, AND ASKED ME

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:33.393 line:0%
TO SEND HER THE LIST OF FAMILY

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:34.494 line:0%
MEMBERS, HE RECALLS.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.296 line:0%
THE NEXT DAY, SHE ASKED ME TO

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:36.696 line:0%
GO TO THE AIRPORT TO 5 IN THE

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:38.364 line:0%
MORNING.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:39.399 line:0%
WE LEFT ALL OF OUR BELONGINGS,

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:42.435 line:0%
AND PROPERTY, BEHIND.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.303 line:0%
SO, WHEN I SAW THE SITUATION AT

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.337 line:0%
THE AIRPORT I THOUGHT, WE

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:47.107 line:0%
WOULDN'T BE ABLE TO GET IN.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:51.111 line:0%
THE TALIBAN WERE FIRING.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:53.313 line:0%
IT BARELY MISSED ME.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:56.049 line:0%
THE ITALIAN GOVERNMENT,

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:56.716 line:0%
MANAGING TO EVACUATE NEARLY

00:01:56.216 --> 00:02:00.019 line:0%
5000 AFGHANS, BEFORE THE

00:01:56.883 --> 00:02:01.121 line:0%
TALIBAN TOOK CONTROL OF THE

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:03.389 line:0%
AIRPORT.

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:05.325 line:0%
THEY LOOK BACK ON THE LAST

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:07.193 line:0%
MONTH WITH MIXED EMOTIONS.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.361 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ON THE ONE HAND, I'M VERY

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:10.263 line:0%
RELIEVED THAT THEY ARE HERE,

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:13.032 line:0%
AND THAT THEY WERE ABLE TO COME

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:14.234 line:0%
TO ITALY, BUT, I AM VERY

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:15.301 line:0%
WORRIED ABOUT EVERYONE ELSE,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.702 line:0%
WHO COULD NOT LEAVE THE

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:18.037 line:0%
COUNTRY.

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:20.173 line:0%
SO, MY THOUGHT IS ALSO WITH

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:22.208 line:0%
THEM.

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.309 line:0%
&gt;&gt; BARELY A MONTH IN ITALY, SHE

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:27.046 line:0%
MOURNS THE LIFE SHE LOST.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:29.048 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I LOVE MY COUNTRY, I LOVE MY

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:32.118 line:0%
PEOPLE, AND I HAVE A LOT OF

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:35.088 line:0%
FRIENDS IN MY COUNTRY.

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:36.089 line:0%
SO, I DON'T KNOW WHAT HAPPENED

00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:41.161 line:0%
TO THEM.

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:46.032 line:0%
IT MAKES ME SO SAD.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:47.167 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AHEAD, NO LYING THE

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:47.167 line:0%
STRANGERS TO ADAPT TO A 

